# The daemon's account, declared (INPUT_GRAMMAR.md IG-Q64, IG-F12): the
# group shekyl and the system user shekyl in it, no home and no login.
# Installed as /usr/lib/sysusers.d/shekyl.conf by the .deb and the .rpm and
# applied by their post-install script. shekyld@.service runs as this account.
# An existing account of that name is used as it is, so pre-install.sh
# refuses one that is a login.
u shekyl - "Shekyl daemon" /nonexistent /usr/sbin/nologin

# The RPC tunnel's account (RPC_CHANNEL.md §8; Rick, 2026-11-21): the group
# shekyl-tunnel and the system user shekyl-tunnel in it, no home and no
# login. Never the daemon's account and never in its group: the tunnel is a
# consumer of the node, and the daemon's configuration is not its to read.
# shekyl-rpc-tunnel.service runs as this account.
u shekyl-tunnel - "Shekyl RPC tunnel" /nonexistent /usr/sbin/nologin
